  ('9f7217be-4702-5aba-a9fd-2dc265ac7005', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g11-argument-writing'), null, 'medium',
   $q$Which detail would most strengthen the response in sentence (9)?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Stage lighting equipment has become much more advanced in recent years.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"irrelevant-detail"},{"text":"Shy students should simply learn to get over their fear of the stage.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"dismissive-tone"},{"text":"Shy people can be very talented in many other areas of life.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"weak-relevance"},{"text":"Last year, nearly a third of the students in Brightwater's spring production worked entirely behind the scenes.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Last year, nearly a third of the students in Brightwater's spring production worked entirely behind the scenes.$q$, $q$The production figure shows that backstage roles are common and real, which supports the claim that no student must perform. The choice telling shy students to get over their fear dismisses the concern rather than answering it.$q$, 'draft', 'd57fbe3c-2159-54a6-9e5b-b08e6e716cae')
